<title>UK: UK M0 and M4 monitoring ranges remain unchanged.</title>
<headline>UK M0 and M4 monitoring ranges remain unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The UK Treasury said on Tuesday that the monitoring ranges for M0 and M4 money supply remained unchanged following Chancellor Kenneth Clarke's budget speech.</p>
<p>The M0 monitoring range is zero to four percent, and M4 is three to nine percent.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7708</p>
</text>
